'''Magnezone''' (Japanese: '''ジバコイル''' ''Jibacoil'') is a {{ct|Lightning}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

