===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Ultra Prism|Magnezone|83}} from the {{TCG|Ultra Prism}} expansion.
*'''Thunder Blast''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Delta Species|Jolteon ex|109}} from the {{TCG|EX Delta Species}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

